        stack,cat,seq,blockArrange,note,n,chord,s,sound,hush,
        sigObj,sigObj,sigObj,sigObj,sigObj,()=>sigObj,sigObj,sigObj,x=>x,x=>x,
        43,50,36,45,40,41
